+  * @brief  enable or disable dma requests.
+  * @param  i2c_x: to select the i2c peripheral.
+  *         this parameter can be one of the following values:
+  *         I2C1, I2C2, I2C3.
+  * @param  new_state (TRUE or FALSE)
+  * @retval none
