+  *
+  * THIS SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED ON "AS IS" BASIS WITHOUT WARRANTIES,
+  * GUARANTEES OR REPRESENTATIONS OF ANY KIND. ARTERY EXPRESSLY DISCLAIMS,
+  * TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, ALL EXPRESS, IMPLIED OR
